data: {"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"lookupStatus\": \"found\",\n    \"comments\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"UgwzGYgzFRUoCdawv0B4AaABAg\",\n        \"text\": \"Speaking from experience, this is 100% spot on. Also STAY AWAY from companies trying to sell you on a recruiting service. It’s yet another waste of money.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2023-11-06T16:18:40.676Z\",\n        \"publishedTimeText\": \"3 years ago\",\n        \"likeCount\": 8,\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"repliesCursor\": null,\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"grammesser7362\",\n          \"displayName\": \"@grammesser7362\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"UC9mBYBzn564ALacZXiduXIw\",\n          \"verified\": false,\n          \"creator\": false,\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kI6IaNLp2ikClmVYej6RdfJ40AeuMA2_gacyuoWj8bbA=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj\",\n          \"channelUrl\": \"https://youtube.com/@grammesser7362\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Ugzo_q3HQ0LbThnfkQV4AaABAg\",\n        \"text\": \"🤯 your arm just disappears!!!!!   Lol.  Great video Dan\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2023-11-06T16:18:40.676Z\",\n        \"publishedTimeText\": \"3 years ago\",\n        \"likeCount\": 2,\n        \"replyCount\": 1,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"Eg0SC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNGAYygwEaUBIaVWd6b19xM0hRMExiVGhuZmtRVjRBYUFCQWciAggAKhhVQ2hsQlF3WUsyWjd6ai1MY2xqMDM3NXcyC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNQAFICoIBAggBQi9jb21tZW50LXJlcGxpZXMtaXRlbS1VZ3pvX3EzSFEwTGJUaG5ma1FWNEFhQUJBZw%3D%3D\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"PedersonPantry\",\n          \"displayName\": \"@PedersonPantry\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"UCw_GFU8PZzFiO-bMuZWCYRQ\",\n          \"verified\": false,\n          \"creator\": false,\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_lqXFhOXQh4LxMsOOeOj8MTTeLnKV0yWCkZ18LRLZo=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj\",\n          \"channelUrl\": \"https://youtube.com/@PedersonPantry\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Ugxhc_JvZfLzNMAtgb14AaABAg\",\n        \"text\": \"Im watching this video excited that my nephew who is 13 and a very talented hitter is going to high school next year and i know he is going to attract some attention. He has been killing it at the plate 2 seasons in a row. And he is a really big strong solid tall kid. Already grown man size at 13. I know scouts will love that. I can't wait to go through the recruiting process with him 😆\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2023-11-06T16:18:40.676Z\",\n        \"publishedTimeText\": \"3 years ago\",\n        \"likeCount\": 1,\n        \"replyCount\": 1,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"Eg0SC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNGAYygwEaUBIaVWd4aGNfSnZaZkx6Tk1BdGdiMTRBYUFCQWciAggAKhhVQ2hsQlF3WUsyWjd6ai1MY2xqMDM3NXcyC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNQAFICoIBAggBQi9jb21tZW50LXJlcGxpZXMtaXRlbS1VZ3hoY19KdlpmTHpOTUF0Z2IxNEFhQUJBZw%3D%3D\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"worldtraveler8613\",\n          \"displayName\": \"@worldtraveler8613\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"UC_FBxDhpZ45Fmv8BRuETErQ\",\n          \"verified\": false,\n          \"creator\": false,\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_lW3NLDUkwiQqx5VubFjNoDKLR2ssd3u_xYzmghv-g=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj\",\n          \"channelUrl\": \"https://youtube.com/@worldtraveler8613\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Ugwj1Nlkv54YXK5A3114AaABAg\",\n        \"text\": \"Thanks Dan. Have an Eighth grader and this info is PRICELESS. Getting invites left and right. Was being made to feel we were behind the curve. Thank you!\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2024-11-06T16:18:40.676Z\",\n        \"publishedTimeText\": \"2 years ago\",\n        \"likeCount\": 2,\n        \"replyCount\": 1,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"Eg0SC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNGAYygwEaUBIaVWd3ajFObGt2NTRZWEs1QTMxMTRBYUFCQWciAggAKhhVQ2hsQlF3WUsyWjd6ai1MY2xqMDM3NXcyC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNQAFICoIBAggBQi9jb21tZW50LXJlcGxpZXMtaXRlbS1VZ3dqMU5sa3Y1NFlYSzVBMzExNEFhQUJBZw%3D%3D\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"BrooklynPaulie\",\n          \"displayName\": \"@BrooklynPaulie\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"UClSIl4AwA9pBg_Fo9s9PkTw\",\n          \"verified\": false,\n          \"creator\": false,\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_nSNiYSvPvCCpOaA3XQDR5Z1JbETTCUrC0epju2BYRcUAhWBpYB6ETxcv4epfmtCNjofw=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj\",\n          \"channelUrl\": \"https://youtube.com/@BrooklynPaulie\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"UgwtgqcrV-ty6HN4ccV4AaABAg\",\n        \"text\": \"If you deserve to be there they will find you\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2024-11-06T16:18:40.676Z\",\n        \"publishedTimeText\": \"2 years ago\",\n        \"likeCount\": 0,\n        \"replyCount\": 2,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"Eg0SC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNGAYygwEaUBIaVWd3dGdxY3JWLXR5NkhONGNjVjRBYUFCQWciAggAKhhVQ2hsQlF3WUsyWjd6ai1MY2xqMDM3NXcyC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNQAFICoIBAggBQi9jb21tZW50LXJlcGxpZXMtaXRlbS1VZ3d0Z3FjclYtdHk2SE40Y2NWNEFhQUJBZw%3D%3D\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"berniegordon6338\",\n          \"displayName\": \"@berniegordon6338\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"UCNMjC1XhaEgiiuzmMJf2K9A\",\n          \"verified\": false,\n          \"creator\": false,\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_lqVfG1lyjpdYC2qaVwAkIPWFy5VVtOHR11CzwKLs4xXds=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj\",\n          \"channelUrl\": \"https://youtube.com/@berniegordon6338\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"UgzDoT_o12HwNP8GVGt4AaABAg\",\n        \"text\": \"A hot topic going around central Texas could be good content for you. My daughter’s 12u team is cutting players mid season and stealing players from other teams. Even though the new players are about the same as those cut, other teams are folding and limiting competition among A level teams.  The sales pitch is that the coaches have connections to get girls to college and play the biggest tournaments. A lot of naive families are falling for it. The girls getting cut are coming from less naive families and parents who played college ball.  This is the talk of the area how top level players are scrambling to find a new team mid season because their team folded from having players stolen. \\n\\nMy daughter was removed from the team because I did some digging in to the background of the new paid coach. He was fired from another organization for adultery issues and we are pretty sure there is a history of drug problems.  My daughter was the leading batting average and now 2 tournaments gone is still the RBI leader. \\n\\nGiven how hot this is on the Facebook message boards in Texas, it will probably make for some good content to talk about con men claiming college connections for 11 year olds and superior training knowledge.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2025-11-06T16:18:40.676Z\",\n        \"publishedTimeText\": \"1 year ago\",\n        \"likeCount\": 0,\n        \"replyCount\": 1,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"Eg0SC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNGAYygwEaUBIaVWd6RG9UX28xMkh3TlA4R1ZHdDRBYUFCQWciAggAKhhVQ2hsQlF3WUsyWjd6ai1MY2xqMDM3NXcyC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNQAFICoIBAggBQi9jb21tZW50LXJlcGxpZXMtaXRlbS1VZ3pEb1RfbzEySHdOUDhHVkd0NEFhQUJBZw%3D%3D\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"artrail20\",\n          \"displayName\": \"@artrail20\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"UCKD9FtqtvawrCc5wax97K6w\",\n          \"verified\": false,\n          \"creator\": false,\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://yt3.ggpht.com/w_Gyzgy-uUXqNbwyl2wTAfgGY2IhQtG2rxbqZJXHNz7on0-ee5TTeOzobjSKZMGLjf5qQH1FM5g=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj\",\n          \"channelUrl\": \"https://youtube.com/@artrail20\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Ugy1lURLe8mUS-bPCg14AaABAg\",\n        \"text\": \"Great advice, especially about capturing strong video and editing. More often than not you see video captured on a iPhone from way back in the stands. Then, you have to squint to find little Johnny in the action.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2023-11-06T16:18:40.676Z\",\n        \"publishedTimeText\": \"3 years ago\",\n        \"likeCount\": 0,\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"repliesCursor\": null,\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"highlights5397\",\n          \"displayName\": \"@highlights5397\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"UCHKYWSehwnR1Pf_Ml7jjAtw\",\n          \"verified\": false,\n          \"creator\": false,\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_nKOqIVC_wjCGDpD96rhr1ZSOIcdvmYOi5pFdtljKl4eJy8AVLi8mdgjfZHrXpiFTZecw=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj\",\n          \"channelUrl\": \"https://youtube.com/@highlights5397\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"UgwNhkPi2hxz2zFJwIJ4AaABAg\",\n        \"text\": \"Heard or read this somewhere  \\\" don't pursue getting college exposure,  if it means getting exposed \\\" . Great video.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2023-11-06T16:18:40.676Z\",\n        \"publishedTimeText\": \"3 years ago\",\n        \"likeCount\": 0,\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"repliesCursor\": null,\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"Steve-gj3gf\",\n          \"displayName\": \"@Steve-gj3gf\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"UCIvB0pGebOI5Y3AV4O9Op_Q\",\n          \"verified\": false,\n          \"creator\": false,\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_l_fjzHCty0H4YaXRKJKl1x8bn4iFQpXB6OPw1sEXU=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj\",\n          \"channelUrl\": \"https://youtube.com/@Steve-gj3gf\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"UgzhVzYYpgOEAt1Wkg54AaABAg\",\n        \"text\": \"A good juco has a lot of ppl who were at d1 schools and transferred\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2024-11-06T16:18:40.676Z\",\n        \"publishedTimeText\": \"2 years ago\",\n        \"likeCount\": 0,\n        \"replyCount\": 1,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"Eg0SC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNGAYygwEaUBIaVWd6aFZ6WVlwZ09FQXQxV2tnNTRBYUFCQWciAggAKhhVQ2hsQlF3WUsyWjd6ai1MY2xqMDM3NXcyC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNQAFICoIBAggBQi9jb21tZW50LXJlcGxpZXMtaXRlbS1VZ3poVnpZWXBnT0VBdDFXa2c1NEFhQUJBZw%3D%3D\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"lanelineberger3461\",\n          \"displayName\": \"@lanelineberger3461\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"UCo6HID5cr_YLUbQNnhVMwkA\",\n          \"verified\": false,\n          \"creator\": false,\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://yt3.ggpht.com/JC6Kz_pXg5ZhI6nz0OdY0wy21EdtitQ8dAH6KXZdzAvM8jCSai0Jukel10ky8lzsqUtbm8Cn=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj\",\n          \"channelUrl\": \"https://youtube.com/@lanelineberger3461\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"UgwzunB_bLn5aLfFPd54AaABAg\",\n        \"text\": \"Great video, Dan!\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2023-11-06T16:18:40.676Z\",\n        \"publishedTimeText\": \"3 years ago\",\n        \"likeCount\": 1,\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"repliesCursor\": null,\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"NFHSNetwork\",\n          \"displayName\": \"@NFHSNetwork\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"UCzK6BAUVrl5Be8LOF19hfpA\",\n          \"verified\": false,\n          \"creator\": false,\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://yt3.ggpht.com/I2qPWqSqSzviRD0iT7ZztM2JtwRaRdwoWf7QUNYrAu_WyTk3iA1Bn8ap_vftaczIch-639MEng=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj\",\n          \"channelUrl\": \"https://youtube.com/@NFHSNetwork\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"UgyxCXBkmbkHn05VaWF4AaABAg\",\n        \"text\": \"Thank you, Coach.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2024-11-06T16:18:40.676Z\",\n        \"publishedTimeText\": \"2 years ago\",\n        \"likeCount\": 1,\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"repliesCursor\": null,\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"SwitchHittingDaily\",\n          \"displayName\": \"@SwitchHittingDaily\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"UC84AHGWkwAFEpYTsGABfbyQ\",\n          \"verified\": false,\n          \"creator\": false,\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://yt3.ggpht.com/CFdVoEh15Oquq7l5SPrlu0s04BbAxFftzo9T5t7Ye114Bc0ap_1USH3KDMWzz5ZKqsZnTAYCcw=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj\",\n          \"channelUrl\": \"https://youtube.com/@SwitchHittingDaily\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Ugz-nH7LypFm5uzPfqV4AaABAg\",\n        \"text\": \"Can/should you email a coach before you have a recruiting video? How important is game film in the recruiting video?\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2024-11-06T16:18:40.676Z\",\n        \"publishedTimeText\": \"2 years ago\",\n        \"likeCount\": 0,\n        \"replyCount\": 3,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"Eg0SC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNGAYygwEaUBIaVWd6LW5IN0x5cEZtNXV6UGZxVjRBYUFCQWciAggAKhhVQ2hsQlF3WUsyWjd6ai1MY2xqMDM3NXcyC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNQAFICoIBAggBQi9jb21tZW50LXJlcGxpZXMtaXRlbS1VZ3otbkg3THlwRm01dXpQZnFWNEFhQUJBZw%3D%3D\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"kingyak7\",\n          \"displayName\": \"@kingyak7\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"UC2fxQrT-bzacBXZ3lJ742kA\",\n          \"verified\": false,\n          \"creator\": false,\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_lCP9J8wYurQQPaJJzQsnZVuUXt1SEqg_LHJzBetAc=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj\",\n          \"channelUrl\": \"https://youtube.com/@kingyak7\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"UgxkTv3_nZ9SZWmk8-l4AaABAg\",\n        \"text\": \"Do you record the whole game to get a couple clips from the infield?\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2024-11-06T16:18:40.676Z\",\n        \"publishedTimeText\": \"2 years ago\",\n        \"likeCount\": 0,\n        \"replyCount\": 1,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"Eg0SC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNGAYygwEaUBIaVWd4a1R2M19uWjlTWldtazgtbDRBYUFCQWciAggAKhhVQ2hsQlF3WUsyWjd6ai1MY2xqMDM3NXcyC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNQAFICoIBAggBQi9jb21tZW50LXJlcGxpZXMtaXRlbS1VZ3hrVHYzX25aOVNaV21rOC1sNEFhQUJBZw%3D%3D\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"kingyak7\",\n          \"displayName\": \"@kingyak7\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"UC2fxQrT-bzacBXZ3lJ742kA\",\n          \"verified\": false,\n          \"creator\": false,\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_lCP9J8wYurQQPaJJzQsnZVuUXt1SEqg_LHJzBetAc=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj\",\n          \"channelUrl\": \"https://youtube.com/@kingyak7\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"UgwWz6FjQypAYR-kPil4AaABAg\",\n        \"text\": \"nice vid...however a lot of the FL JC's would kick the shit out of mid level and lower level D1 schools.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2024-11-06T16:18:40.676Z\",\n        \"publishedTimeText\": \"2 years ago\",\n        \"likeCount\": 0,\n        \"replyCount\": 1,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"Eg0SC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNGAYygwEaUBIaVWd3V3o2RmpReXBBWVIta1BpbDRBYUFCQWciAggAKhhVQ2hsQlF3WUsyWjd6ai1MY2xqMDM3NXcyC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNQAFICoIBAggBQi9jb21tZW50LXJlcGxpZXMtaXRlbS1VZ3dXejZGalF5cEFZUi1rUGlsNEFhQUJBZw%3D%3D\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"rodfenster4776\",\n          \"displayName\": \"@rodfenster4776\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"UCFPl9bfGpHoRYTZ2iouiZRw\",\n          \"verified\": false,\n          \"creator\": false,\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mYIHNxd93rACQka74USMa2k63qjtLdPoUSKPkjfSi8PwA=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj\",\n          \"channelUrl\": \"https://youtube.com/@rodfenster4776\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Ugz56q0R4ucLJpWbDxV4AaABAg\",\n        \"text\": \"What kind of camera do you recommend and what are these free video editing softwares?\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2024-11-06T16:18:40.676Z\",\n        \"publishedTimeText\": \"2 years ago\",\n        \"likeCount\": 0,\n        \"replyCount\": 0,\n        \"repliesCursor\": null,\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"janelleferlan2929\",\n          \"displayName\": \"@janelleferlan2929\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"UCilWPOG4TPEruVWGNCHFkew\",\n          \"verified\": false,\n          \"creator\": false,\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mNkzjUm3q1LDRpd6D9tArL_NjrWOgRo7bnpYByoqs=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj\",\n          \"channelUrl\": \"https://youtube.com/@janelleferlan2929\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"UgxFiLhQICV9DBiTz154AaABAg\",\n        \"text\": \"Is travel baseball a good option for the money and at what age is it best to\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2025-11-06T16:18:40.676Z\",\n        \"publishedTimeText\": \"1 year ago\",\n        \"likeCount\": 0,\n        \"replyCount\": 1,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"Eg0SC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNGAYygwEaUBIaVWd4RmlMaFFJQ1Y5REJpVHoxNTRBYUFCQWciAggAKhhVQ2hsQlF3WUsyWjd6ai1MY2xqMDM3NXcyC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNQAFICoIBAggBQi9jb21tZW50LXJlcGxpZXMtaXRlbS1VZ3hGaUxoUUlDVjlEQmlUejE1NEFhQUJBZw%3D%3D\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"FBE_sports\",\n          \"displayName\": \"@FBE_sports\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"UCeOTFTin-O5rQx1ijUEEoEg\",\n          \"verified\": false,\n          \"creator\": false,\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://yt3.ggpht.com/CfqeKyKfAZY5MEd7rKH4ej7h2pYI2EToRXBcxu_ET_gZmEXYya2I1WJMQj_hZHmmoCrielN68A=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj\",\n          \"channelUrl\": \"https://youtube.com/@FBE_sports\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"UgyBxT2zwhvQfNuEIi54AaABAg\",\n        \"text\": \"Hey coach Dan. Any advice on what I should be doing as a freshman who is on his varsity team?\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2023-11-06T16:18:40.676Z\",\n        \"publishedTimeText\": \"3 years ago\",\n        \"likeCount\": 0,\n        \"replyCount\": 1,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"Eg0SC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNGAYygwEaUBIaVWd5QnhUMnp3aHZRZk51RUlpNTRBYUFCQWciAggAKhhVQ2hsQlF3WUsyWjd6ai1MY2xqMDM3NXcyC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNQAFICoIBAggBQi9jb21tZW50LXJlcGxpZXMtaXRlbS1VZ3lCeFQyendodlFmTnVFSWk1NEFhQUJBZw%3D%3D\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"chessbricks2134\",\n          \"displayName\": \"@chessbricks2134\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"UCkzcNX-N9RgUCEzGufvPz-w\",\n          \"verified\": false,\n          \"creator\": false,\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://yt3.ggpht.com/BMWOajVVKnvBcSdztep5f4D0SdhiP3ALnL2OPNCNfMqsvA4tjQY1y7P_4cm4DuLYge66CUdceQ=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj\",\n          \"channelUrl\": \"https://youtube.com/@chessbricks2134\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"Ugwonz9iiKG-hnCZ4rp4AaABAg\",\n        \"text\": \"HI Coach Dan my name is Adolfo Silva, Im a senior from Canada (2006). I am 6'3 and 215 pounds. Ive always been a big tall kid and wanted to persue baseball late. I started playing competitive baseball As a 3B,1B and P at 16U. My levels were (16U)AA, (17U)A and Now this year again (18U)AA. I have been playing house league which is an open league and never got the chance to start  REP before because my parents were busy. I never thought I had to do research for College baseball I just thought about playing. Ive done research by looking at some tips on NCSA And this video together. Ive done research on camps, showcases about emailing schools (D1,D2 D3 NAIA JUCO) and making a skills video which ill start my next practise but I feel like I'm out of time and need guidance for my situation, a straight path to head towards and steps to overcome and move forward with, with your expertise. I really want this and have a passion for baseball so if you could help me out that would be great. thanks for the great video! Thanks again Coach Dan\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2024-11-06T16:18:40.676Z\",\n        \"publishedTimeText\": \"2 years ago\",\n        \"likeCount\": 0,\n        \"replyCount\": 1,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"Eg0SC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNGAYygwEaUBIaVWd3b256OWlpS0ctaG5DWjRycDRBYUFCQWciAggAKhhVQ2hsQlF3WUsyWjd6ai1MY2xqMDM3NXcyC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNQAFICoIBAggBQi9jb21tZW50LXJlcGxpZXMtaXRlbS1VZ3dvbno5aWlLRy1obkNaNHJwNEFhQUJBZw%3D%3D\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"adolfosilva1971\",\n          \"displayName\": \"@adolfosilva1971\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"UC0zdWXWJH7fTEMXaeXvmoag\",\n          \"verified\": false,\n          \"creator\": false,\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kOa_eoEqWZSZ3g0rTXDM_wgEXZs3yR6Px533lMZHChgw=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj\",\n          \"channelUrl\": \"https://youtube.com/@adolfosilva1971\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"UgyLUIh46Kfg1oqUWNN4AaABAg\",\n        \"text\": \"Hey coach Dan, I’m a senior in high school and I decided I want to take baseball seriously but I didn’t play in high school. Is it too late to start even if I give it my all? If not how do I even start?\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2023-11-06T16:18:40.676Z\",\n        \"publishedTimeText\": \"3 years ago\",\n        \"likeCount\": 0,\n        \"replyCount\": 3,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"Eg0SC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNGAYygwEaUBIaVWd5TFVJaDQ2S2ZnMW9xVVdOTjRBYUFCQWciAggAKhhVQ2hsQlF3WUsyWjd6ai1MY2xqMDM3NXcyC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNQAFICoIBAggBQi9jb21tZW50LXJlcGxpZXMtaXRlbS1VZ3lMVUloNDZLZmcxb3FVV05ONEFhQUJBZw%3D%3D\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"xjperez07\",\n          \"displayName\": \"@xjperez07\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"UCYlBC3vmtb8Ay7d7riwYMag\",\n          \"verified\": false,\n          \"creator\": false,\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://yt3.ggpht.com/TiiuOQ49qdLOhbkcCoaY84DDiDnxevqiq23CV50e49hzrWnpPrJX0XTxxk8he8DBbb61TIeZrg=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj\",\n          \"channelUrl\": \"https://youtube.com/@xjperez07\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"UgyQ1JBuH8TZJFS6Zdx4AaABAg\",\n        \"text\": \"Hey there Dan - is there a certain time of year the colleges start posting their camp dates?  I've been keeping an eye on a lot of the local colleges, and none of them have camp dates posted.   I'm assuming they happen after the college season... but you know what they say about assumptions.\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2024-11-06T16:18:40.676Z\",\n        \"publishedTimeText\": \"2 years ago\",\n        \"likeCount\": 0,\n        \"replyCount\": 1,\n        \"repliesCursor\": \"Eg0SC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNGAYygwEaUBIaVWd5UTFKQnVIOFRaSkZTNlpkeDRBYUFCQWciAggAKhhVQ2hsQlF3WUsyWjd6ai1MY2xqMDM3NXcyC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNQAFICoIBAggBQi9jb21tZW50LXJlcGxpZXMtaXRlbS1VZ3lRMUpCdUg4VFpKRlM2WmR4NEFhQUJBZw%3D%3D\",\n        \"author\": {\n          \"handle\": \"mybal_sarichi\",\n          \"displayName\": \"@mybal_sarichi\",\n          \"platformUserId\": \"UCe3Wd6rR1Qy7buweuPg-CAg\",\n          \"verified\": false,\n          \"creator\": false,\n          \"avatarUrl\": \"https://yt3.ggpht.com/8bAXb7DWqWEsx6WEsBFkV2cX8_JjJ9oejN0HC0TinnquDdbTJVYq8Cx38ethBmL9kZVm-ODL1w=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj\",\n          \"channelUrl\": \"https://youtube.com/@mybal_sarichi\"\n        }\n      }\n    ],\n    \"page\": {\n      \"nextCursor\": \"\",\n      \"hasMore\": true\n    }\n  },\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"requestId\": \"req_30bd276c-a83d-469a-a06d-09a63a1a41a1\",\n    \"creditsCharged\": 1,\n    \"version\": \"v1\"\n  }\n}"},{"type":"text","text":"{\"conversation_id\":\"01a1b1a7-a8cf-710b-b70b-5a182753a7ff\"}"}],"structuredContent":{"data":{"lookupStatus":"found","comments":[{"id":"UgwzGYgzFRUoCdawv0B4AaABAg","text":"Speaking from experience, this is 100% spot on. Also STAY AWAY from companies trying to sell you on a recruiting service. It’s yet another waste of money.","createdAt":"2023-11-06T16:18:40.676Z","publishedTimeText":"3 years ago","likeCount":8,"replyCount":0,"repliesCursor":null,"author":{"handle":"grammesser7362","displayName":"@grammesser7362","platformUserId":"UC9mBYBzn564ALacZXiduXIw","verified":false,"creator":false,"avatarUrl":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kI6IaNLp2ikClmVYej6RdfJ40AeuMA2_gacyuoWj8bbA=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj","channelUrl":"https://youtube.com/@grammesser7362"}},{"id":"Ugzo_q3HQ0LbThnfkQV4AaABAg","text":"🤯 your arm just disappears!!!!!   Lol.  Great video Dan","createdAt":"2023-11-06T16:18:40.676Z","publishedTimeText":"3 years ago","likeCount":2,"replyCount":1,"repliesCursor":"Eg0SC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNGAYygwEaUBIaVWd6b19xM0hRMExiVGhuZmtRVjRBYUFCQWciAggAKhhVQ2hsQlF3WUsyWjd6ai1MY2xqMDM3NXcyC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNQAFICoIBAggBQi9jb21tZW50LXJlcGxpZXMtaXRlbS1VZ3pvX3EzSFEwTGJUaG5ma1FWNEFhQUJBZw%3D%3D","author":{"handle":"PedersonPantry","displayName":"@PedersonPantry","platformUserId":"UCw_GFU8PZzFiO-bMuZWCYRQ","verified":false,"creator":false,"avatarUrl":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_lqXFhOXQh4LxMsOOeOj8MTTeLnKV0yWCkZ18LRLZo=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj","channelUrl":"https://youtube.com/@PedersonPantry"}},{"id":"Ugxhc_JvZfLzNMAtgb14AaABAg","text":"Im watching this video excited that my nephew who is 13 and a very talented hitter is going to high school next year and i know he is going to attract some attention. He has been killing it at the plate 2 seasons in a row. And he is a really big strong solid tall kid. Already grown man size at 13. I know scouts will love that. I can't wait to go through the recruiting process with him 😆","createdAt":"2023-11-06T16:18:40.676Z","publishedTimeText":"3 years ago","likeCount":1,"replyCount":1,"repliesCursor":"Eg0SC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNGAYygwEaUBIaVWd4aGNfSnZaZkx6Tk1BdGdiMTRBYUFCQWciAggAKhhVQ2hsQlF3WUsyWjd6ai1MY2xqMDM3NXcyC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNQAFICoIBAggBQi9jb21tZW50LXJlcGxpZXMtaXRlbS1VZ3hoY19KdlpmTHpOTUF0Z2IxNEFhQUJBZw%3D%3D","author":{"handle":"worldtraveler8613","displayName":"@worldtraveler8613","platformUserId":"UC_FBxDhpZ45Fmv8BRuETErQ","verified":false,"creator":false,"avatarUrl":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_lW3NLDUkwiQqx5VubFjNoDKLR2ssd3u_xYzmghv-g=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj","channelUrl":"https://youtube.com/@worldtraveler8613"}},{"id":"Ugwj1Nlkv54YXK5A3114AaABAg","text":"Thanks Dan. Have an Eighth grader and this info is PRICELESS. Getting invites left and right. Was being made to feel we were behind the curve. Thank you!","createdAt":"2024-11-06T16:18:40.676Z","publishedTimeText":"2 years ago","likeCount":2,"replyCount":1,"repliesCursor":"Eg0SC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNGAYygwEaUBIaVWd3ajFObGt2NTRZWEs1QTMxMTRBYUFCQWciAggAKhhVQ2hsQlF3WUsyWjd6ai1MY2xqMDM3NXcyC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNQAFICoIBAggBQi9jb21tZW50LXJlcGxpZXMtaXRlbS1VZ3dqMU5sa3Y1NFlYSzVBMzExNEFhQUJBZw%3D%3D","author":{"handle":"BrooklynPaulie","displayName":"@BrooklynPaulie","platformUserId":"UClSIl4AwA9pBg_Fo9s9PkTw","verified":false,"creator":false,"avatarUrl":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_nSNiYSvPvCCpOaA3XQDR5Z1JbETTCUrC0epju2BYRcUAhWBpYB6ETxcv4epfmtCNjofw=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj","channelUrl":"https://youtube.com/@BrooklynPaulie"}},{"id":"UgwtgqcrV-ty6HN4ccV4AaABAg","text":"If you deserve to be there they will find you","createdAt":"2024-11-06T16:18:40.676Z","publishedTimeText":"2 years ago","likeCount":0,"replyCount":2,"repliesCursor":"Eg0SC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNGAYygwEaUBIaVWd3dGdxY3JWLXR5NkhONGNjVjRBYUFCQWciAggAKhhVQ2hsQlF3WUsyWjd6ai1MY2xqMDM3NXcyC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNQAFICoIBAggBQi9jb21tZW50LXJlcGxpZXMtaXRlbS1VZ3d0Z3FjclYtdHk2SE40Y2NWNEFhQUJBZw%3D%3D","author":{"handle":"berniegordon6338","displayName":"@berniegordon6338","platformUserId":"UCNMjC1XhaEgiiuzmMJf2K9A","verified":false,"creator":false,"avatarUrl":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_lqVfG1lyjpdYC2qaVwAkIPWFy5VVtOHR11CzwKLs4xXds=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj","channelUrl":"https://youtube.com/@berniegordon6338"}},{"id":"UgzDoT_o12HwNP8GVGt4AaABAg","text":"A hot topic going around central Texas could be good content for you. My daughter’s 12u team is cutting players mid season and stealing players from other teams. Even though the new players are about the same as those cut, other teams are folding and limiting competition among A level teams.  The sales pitch is that the coaches have connections to get girls to college and play the biggest tournaments. A lot of naive families are falling for it. The girls getting cut are coming from less naive families and parents who played college ball.  This is the talk of the area how top level players are scrambling to find a new team mid season because their team folded from having players stolen. \n\nMy daughter was removed from the team because I did some digging in to the background of the new paid coach. He was fired from another organization for adultery issues and we are pretty sure there is a history of drug problems.  My daughter was the leading batting average and now 2 tournaments gone is still the RBI leader. \n\nGiven how hot this is on the Facebook message boards in Texas, it will probably make for some good content to talk about con men claiming college connections for 11 year olds and superior training knowledge.","createdAt":"2025-11-06T16:18:40.676Z","publishedTimeText":"1 year ago","likeCount":0,"replyCount":1,"repliesCursor":"Eg0SC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNGAYygwEaUBIaVWd6RG9UX28xMkh3TlA4R1ZHdDRBYUFCQWciAggAKhhVQ2hsQlF3WUsyWjd6ai1MY2xqMDM3NXcyC0dPb2trVzBNTjhNQAFICoIBAggBQi9jb21tZW50LXJlcGxpZXMtaXRlbS1VZ3pEb1RfbzEySHdOUDhHVkd0NEFhQUJBZw%3D%3D","author":{"handle":"artrail20","displayName":"@artrail20","platformUserId":"UCKD9FtqtvawrCc5wax97K6w","verified":false,"creator":false,"avatarUrl":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/w_Gyzgy-uUXqNbwyl2wTAfgGY2IhQtG2rxbqZJXHNz7on0-ee5TTeOzobjSKZMGLjf5qQH1FM5g=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj","channelUrl":"https://youtube.com/@artrail20"}},{"id":"Ugy1lURLe8mUS-bPCg14AaABAg","text":"Great advice, especially about capturing strong video and editing. More often than not you see video captured on a iPhone from way back in the stands. Then, you have to squint to find little Johnny in the action.","createdAt":"2023-11-06T16:18:40.676Z","publishedTimeText":"3 years ago","likeCount":0,"replyCount":0,"repliesCursor":null,"author":{"handle":"highlights5397","displayName":"@highlights5397","platformUserId":"UCHKYWSehwnR1Pf_Ml7jjAtw","verified":false,"creator":false,"avatarUrl":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_nKOqIVC_wjCGDpD96rhr1ZSOIcdvmYOi5pFdtljKl4eJy8AVLi8mdgjfZHrXpiFTZecw=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj","channelUrl":"https://youtube.com/@highlights5397"}},{"id":"UgwNhkPi2hxz2zFJwIJ4AaABAg","text":"Heard or read this somewhere  \" don't pursue getting college exposure,  if it means getting exposed \" . Great video.","createdAt":"2023-11-06T16:18:40.676Z","publishedTimeText":"3 years ago","likeCount":0,"replyCount":0,"repliesCursor":null,"author":{"handle":"Steve-gj3gf","displayName":"@Steve-gj3gf","platformUserId":"UCIvB0pGebOI5Y3AV4O9Op_Q","verified":false,"creator":false,"avatarUrl":"https://y